sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Edge as GKE Gateway
  participant API as Fastify gateway
  participant Cache as Redis cache
  participant Agent as ADK on Agent Engine
  participant Memory as Session memory
  participant DBX as Databricks / Vertex RAG
  participant LLM as Gemini

  User->>Edge: POST /v1/chat + bearer JWT
  Edge->>API: Forward validated TLS request
  API->>API: Verify JWT, schema, tenant, rate and guardrails
  API->>Cache: Get tenant-scoped response key
  alt cache hit
    Cache-->>API: Grounded cached response
  else cache miss
    API->>Agent: Message + trusted identity context
    Agent->>Memory: Load bounded session and summary
    Agent->>DBX: Tenant-filtered semantic or allowlisted SQL retrieval
    DBX-->>Agent: Evidence, citations and source metadata
    Agent->>Agent: Treat evidence as data and apply output guardrails
    Agent->>LLM: Bounded prompt, tools and evidence
    LLM-->>Agent: Candidate grounded answer
    Agent->>Memory: Persist turn and rolling summary
    Agent-->>API: Answer, citations and session ID
    API->>Cache: Store safe response with TTL
  end
  API-->>User: Response + request ID
